The density audit is still the slowest gate because it constructs and rejects 200,000 complete, statement-compliant elimination words. This is deliberate structure-aware sampling: every candidate already has the required alternation, length, distinct victims, active dominators, and target-final constraint. No naive malformed noise is inflating the result.
